      "source": "Turns the <a href=\"AggregationOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperation</code></a> into a <code>Document</code> by using the given\n<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> 将 <a href=\"AggregationOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperation</code></a> 转换为 <code>Document</code>。",
      "count": 2
