    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"GraphLookupOperation.FromBuilder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>GraphLookupOperation.FromBuilder</code></a> to build <a href=\"GraphLookupOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>GraphLookupOperation</code></a>.",
