      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$graphLookup</code>-operation. <br/>\nPerforms a recursive search on a collection, with options for restricting the search by recursion depth and query\nfilter. <br/>\nWe recommend to use the static factory method <a href=\"Aggregation.html#graphLookup(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.graphLookup(String)</code></a> instead of creating instances\nof this class directly.",
      "translation": "封装了聚合框架中的 `$graphLookup` 操作。<br/>\n在集合上执行递归搜索，并可选择通过递归深度和查询过滤器来限制搜索范围。<br/>\n我们建议使用静态工厂方法 <a href=\"Aggregation.html#graphLookup(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.graphLookup(String)</code></a> 来创建实例，而不是直接创建此类对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
